// Drive cloud relay: the iOS Google OAuth client. Tracked; holds no id.
//
// A Google iOS OAuth client is bound to one GCP project + bundle ID, so it cannot be shared — every builder
// mints their own (ArchiveCapture/README-oauth.md, "iPhone companion"). Put it in the gitignored
// DriveLocal.xcconfig next to this file, one line:
//
//     DRIVE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID = 1234567890-abcdef.apps.googleusercontent.com
//
// and rebuild (the include is read at build time; no `xcodegen generate` needed). Absent that file the id stays empty, the app
// builds, Drive sign-in is hidden and Wi-Fi capture works as normal (Net/DriveOAuthConfig.swift).

DRIVE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID =

#include? "DriveLocal.xcconfig"
